X     Land Mine is a program that creates random "mines" on a SunView 
X     screen.  I got the idea for this about a year ago when someone
X     ran the "termite" program on my sun.  I swore to get "even" and
X     eventually, when I found the time, I wrote this code.
X
X     The number of land mines generated by this program is determined
X     by a define near the top of the C file.  If you want more than
X     150 mines, increase the number for the NUM_MINES define.  By 
X     increasing the number of mines however, you will cause the system 
X     to slow down considerably!  If you want a larger "hit" area, 
X     increase the PIXEL_AREA define.  Inceasing this number will not
X     change the speed at which the workstation is performing.
X
X     Thanks to Chuck Musciano of Harris and his "eyecon" program for 
